{"3536660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scary Shadow Spot - All In", "steam_appid": 3536660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/3e82626bdbdf0af1e397bd0f7217f7cd.avif?t=1775580719\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">YOUR DEBT IS $500,000. HOW MUCH ARE YOU WILLING TO LOSE?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Lisa, a 1950s advertising executive with a past destroyed by gambling and a sick daughter to save. A demon offers you a way out: clear your debt by overcoming the 10 floors of your agency.<br><br>But <strong>Scary Shadow Spot 3 - All In</strong> is not your usual anomaly game. It is a <strong>Psychological Roguelite</strong> with deep management mechanics.<br>Your goal is not just to find the right elevator: it is to earn enough money to buy your freedom, before madness (or failure) consumes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/0327a885e93b2e4710134a52acff1d4b.poster.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/0327a885e93b2e4710134a52acff1d4b.webm?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/0327a885e93b2e4710134a52acff1d4b.mp4?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Manage, Observe, Survive. Every choice has a price.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 ROGUELITE: THE ECONOMY OF SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot save the game. If you make a mistake, the loop restarts from Floor 1.<br>Every run is a gamble:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accumulate Wealth:</strong> Earn money by solving minigames and anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dilemma:</strong> Do you deposit the money in the bank to lower the final $500,000 debt? Or do you spend it immediately at the Shop to buy upgrades and survive the current floor?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression:</strong> Even if you lose, you keep your money, unlocked minigames, <strong>Tokens</strong> for permanent upgrades, and <strong>Blueprints</strong> for decoration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/9786e316fc845cdfd911d7aac5d6ab21.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💼 WORK HARD, PLAY DIRTY (THE MINIGAMES)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The agency never stops. On each floor you will unlock new tasks crucial to your earnings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HR Manager:</strong> Analyze résumés. Hire talent, discard impostors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Judge and Executioner:</strong> Decide the fate of employees who make mistakes. Forgiveness or Dismissal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copywriter &amp; Strategist:</strong> Complete advertising slogans and invest in the right campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Tamagotchi:</strong> Raise a 1950s Artificial Intelligence. Bring it to Singularity to obtain bonuses or reset it to collect new rare variants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/12efa548f69bccf19f6fd17467a57cd5.poster.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/12efa548f69bccf19f6fd17467a57cd5.webm?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/12efa548f69bccf19f6fd17467a57cd5.mp4?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👁️ THE AGENCY IS WATCHING YOU... AND OTHER PLAYERS TOO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone in this nightmare. The game world is connected in disturbing ways:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Profiling:</strong> Answer over 1000 unique moral questions. At the end of each run, the game will generate your psychological profile based on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asynchronous Social Play:</strong> Read messages left by other players on the &quot;Notice Board&quot; and observe the &quot;Warning Board&quot;: you will see in real time the fatal mistakes made by other Steam users. Learn from their failures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/afc838323a6d766b39a946dd6611c07b.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏠 CUSTOMIZE YOUR NIGHTMARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond Lisa, you can take care of your space. Find the hidden <strong>Blueprints</strong> during runs to unlock 3D furniture items.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Main Menu:</strong> Modify the appearance of the main menu in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lisa’s Office:</strong> Turn an empty room into your personal sanctuary, adding details as you continue your descent into madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1e11c73d9e04351e961af21663d646f1.poster.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1e11c73d9e04351e961af21663d646f1.webm?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1e11c73d9e04351e961af21663d646f1.mp4?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 THE STORY: CARDS ON THE TABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is Lisa here? Who was her husband? What happened to Andrea?<br>Search for the <strong>Secret Doors</strong> that appear randomly. Enter the flashbacks, relive the past, and collect the <strong>Story Cards</strong>. Only by finding them all will you be able to unlock the true ending and redeem Lisa’s soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES OF &quot;ALL IN&quot;:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Loop:</strong> Die, learn, unlock, repeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Balance greed and caution to pay off the debt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir Atmosphere:</strong> A dive into the advertising aesthetics of the Golden Age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Tension:</strong> If the anomaly doesn’t kill you, your debts will.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536