op to buy upgrades and survive the current floor?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression:</strong> Even if you lose, you keep your money, unlocked minigames, <strong>Tokens</strong> for permanent upgrades, and <strong>Blueprints</strong> for decoration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/9786e316fc845cdfd911d7aac5d6ab21.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💼 WORK HARD, PLAY DIRTY (THE MINIGAMES)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The agency never stops. On each floor you will unlock new tasks crucial to your earnings:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HR Manager:</strong> Analyze résumés. Hire talent, discard impostors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Judge and Executioner:</strong> Decide the fate of employees who make mistakes. Forgiveness or Dismissal?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Copywriter &amp; Strategist:</strong> Complete advertising slogans and invest in the right campaigns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Tamagotchi:</strong> Raise a 1950s Artificial Intelligence. Bring it to Singularity to obtain bonuses or reset it to collect new rare variants.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/12efa548f69bccf19f6fd17467a57cd5.poster.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/12efa548f69bccf19f6fd17467a57cd5.webm?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta