73d9e04351e961af21663d646f1.poster.avif?t=1775580719\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1e11c73d9e04351e961af21663d646f1.webm?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536660/extras/1e11c73d9e04351e961af21663d646f1.mp4?t=1775580719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 THE STORY: CARDS ON THE TABLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why is Lisa here? Who was her husband? What happened to Andrea?<br>Search for the <strong>Secret Doors</strong> that appear randomly. Enter the flashbacks, relive the past, and collect the <strong>Story Cards</strong>. Only by finding them all will you be able to unlock the true ending and redeem Lisa’s soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES OF &quot;ALL IN&quot;:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Loop:</strong> Die, learn, unlock, repeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Balance greed and caution to pay off the debt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir Atmosphere:</strong> A dive into the advertising aesthetics of the Golden Age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Tension:</strong> If the anomaly doesn’t kill you, your debts will.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An Anomaly Game that reads you from the inside. Manage a hellish 1950s agency: hire, fire, and hunt anomalies to repay a $500,000 debt. Roguelite, Management, and Psychological Horror blend together. Every choice matters: the game will create your real psychological profile. Who are you really?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "ht